              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orekoghe wawadia nyerinyeri mfungade kwa mkonu ghwake ghwa kiwomi, momunyi kwake lorefumieghe lufu lukalie chia rose, na wushu ghwake ghorekoghe ghuking'ala-ng'ala sa iruwa jakala na ndighi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani iji neremmbonieghe, nereghueghe maghunyi kwake seji naafwa. Ela ukaniwikiria mkonu ghwake ghwa kiwomi ukaghamba, “Kusakeobua, ini nuo wa imbiri, na wa kutua;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
